From: Mike McQuaid <mike@mikemcquaid.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:21:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve inline formatting in copied selections

Copying across Markdown blocks on macOS loses emphasis and code
styling when pasted into a rich text editor. Preserve that formatting
for whole or partial selections, including text inside table cells.

See also #58 for related work on rich text copying.
